# 仓库里统一存 LF，避免 Windows 上 commit 时反复出现 LF→CRLF 警告
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不做任何换行转换
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.kdbx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 打包产物与锁文件：GitHub 上默认折叠，也避免 diff 噪音
package-lock.json -diff
